{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:03 2026-09-29 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:03 2026-09-29 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:03 2026-09-29 HKT</p><p>今(29日)早上7時48分，黃大仙廟一間地舖，職員返回開舖時發現門鎖被撬，大門打開，舖內有搜掠痕跡，懷疑被爆竊，報警求助，警員到場調查，將案列爆竊跟進，損失有待點算。</p><img alt=\"黃大仙廟地舖發生爆竊案。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8f33f3090cf9bf8d68751d1d52580012/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_08_54_31_2_.jpeg\" title=\"黃大仙廟地舖發生爆竊案。梁國峰攝\"/><p>黃大仙廟地舖發生爆竊案。梁國峰攝</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/641798f7fecaaaea8c784e9c0e66062e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_08_54_32.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員接報到場。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e5e32fd577c36a8007f996cc1ebe3d82/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_08_54_31_1_.jpeg\" title=\"警員接報到場。梁國峰攝\"/><p>警員接報到場。梁國峰攝</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7a67a85b06c0d8f172d62a92ac6b9ea8/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_08_54_31.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T01:20:04.223752+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":4,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}